{
 "note": "JSON Schema keyword semantics the product validator implements (M1-T01). `valid` is the verdict the product validator must give; tests/bundle/test_bundle.py checks that Python jsonschema gives the same verdict, or `python_valid` where Python knowingly differs (ECMA-262 `$`, and numbers HoH cannot compare exactly, which it refuses).",
